@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@residentId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### GET semua penghuni
GET {{baseUrl}}/penghuni

### GET satu penghuni
GET {{baseUrl}}/penghuni/{{residentId}}

### POST penghuni
# @name createResident
POST {{baseUrl}}/penghuni
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rina Maharani",
  "room": "C02",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "moveInDate": "2026-11-15",
  "status": "Active"
}

### PATCH penghuni yang baru dibuat
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/penghuni/{{createResident.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rina Maharani Putri",
  "status": "Leaving"
}

### DELETE penghuni yang baru dibuat
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/penghuni/{{createResident.response.body.id}}

### Error validasi DTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/penghuni
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "X",
  "room": "kamar-1",
  "phone": "08",
  "moveInDate": "bukan-tanggal"
}

### Error konflik: kamar A01 sudah terisi
POST {{baseUrl}}/penghuni
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Penghuni Duplikat",
  "room": "A01",
  "phone": "081234567890",
  "moveInDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### Error 404: ID tidak ditemukan
GET {{baseUrl}}/penghuni/{{residentId}}
